flowchart TB
    Events["Events<br/>push, pull request, schedule,<br/>or manual dispatch"]

    subgraph Workflows["Current GitHub Actions workflows"]
        direction TB
        SecurityCI["Security CI<br/>signed-history policy; frontend lint/build/audit;<br/>NestJS audit/build/tests; Python dependency audits;<br/>base-image/policy checks, provenance, SBOM, Trivy"]
        DesktopCI["Windows desktop workflow<br/>path-filtered PR/main build and tests;<br/>upload MSI artifact (30 days); optional signing job"]
        ClusterCI["Cluster-policy workflow<br/>manual or selected main policy changes;<br/>requires KUBE_CONFIG_B64 to apply Kyverno"]
    end

    DesktopArtifact["Build artifact only<br/>not automatically promoted"]
    ClusterResult["Policy bundle applied only<br/>when cluster credentials are present"]
    NoDeploy["No automatic public web deployment,<br/>container registry push, MSI publication,<br/>or production rollout is configured"]

    Events --> SecurityCI
    Events --> DesktopCI
    Events --> ClusterCI
    DesktopCI --> DesktopArtifact
    ClusterCI --> ClusterResult
    SecurityCI -. validation only .-> NoDeploy
    DesktopArtifact -. separate operator release step .-> NoDeploy
    ClusterResult -. policy deployment only .-> NoDeploy

